# Credentials for the optional live tests in scripts/. This file has no
# leading dot so it is visible in a checkout. To use it, copy it to .env at
# the repo root (`cp env.example .env`) and replace the CHANGEME values. The
# scripts read .env, never this file. Nothing here is needed to run the normal
# test suite (`scripts/go.sh test ./...`) or to use the app.
#
# Each script reads only its own section, so fill in just the destination you
# want to test and leave the other section as it is.
#
#   scripts/s3-live-test.sh    reads the S3 section
#   scripts/sftp-live-test.sh  reads the SFTP section
#
# The scripts source this file as shell: plain KEY=value lines, no spaces
# around "=", and quote a value that contains spaces or shell characters.
# Use a bucket, account or directory you can safely write to. Each test writes
# under a fresh per-run prefix or directory and removes it when it finishes.

# --- S3-compatible bucket (scripts/s3-live-test.sh) ---
# The names say B2 (Backblaze), but any S3-compatible bucket works.

# Host only, no scheme, e.g. s3.us-west-004.backblazeb2.com
B2_ENDPOINT=CHANGEME
# The bucket name (not a bucket ID)
B2_BUCKET_NAME=CHANGEME
# S3 access key ID (a B2 application key ID)
B2_KEY_ID=CHANGEME
# S3 secret access key (a B2 application key)
B2_KEY_KEY=CHANGEME
# Optional. Derived from the endpoint's second dot-separated label when unset
# (us-west-004 for the example above). Uncomment to override it.
#B2_REGION=CHANGEME

# --- SFTP server (scripts/sftp-live-test.sh) ---
# A Hetzner Storage Box by default, but any SFTP server works.

# The host, e.g. u123456.your-storagebox.de
HETZNER_LINK=CHANGEME
# The account, e.g. u123456
HETZNER_USER=CHANGEME
# 23 for a Hetzner Storage Box. Defaults to 22 when unset.
HETZNER_SSH_PORT=CHANGEME
# Absolute path to a private key already authorized on the server (a leading
# ~/ is expanded). Relative paths are rejected.
HETZNER_KEY=CHANGEME
# Use a password instead of a key: remove the HETZNER_KEY line above and
# uncomment this one.
#HETZNER_PASSWORD=CHANGEME
